  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Law Centre for Southern Africa Prog. support - Tralac Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Trade Law Centre for Southern Africa Programst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till Trade Law Centre for Southern Africa (Tralac) syftar till att &#xf6;ka m&#xe4;ngden afrikansk producerade studier och annan kunskap inom  omr&#xe5;det handel och regional integration i &#xf6;stra och s&#xf6;dra Afrika.     Materialet kommer ocks&#xe5; att spridas till en bred publik bland annat   genom tidningsartiklar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to Trade Law Centre for Southern Africa (Tralac) is       aiming to increasing the amount of African produced studies and other knowledge within trade and regional integration in eastern and        southern Africa. The material will also be disseminated to a broader  public through media.</narrative>
  </description>
